<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<font face="arial"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Hello&nbsp;{!Contact.FirstName},</span></font><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 16px;">You recently requested some information on the Biology graduate program at ASU. Please review this&nbsp;<a href="https://sols.asu.edu/graduate-studies/degrees/biology">useful website</a>; it will provide you with an overview of the program along with detailed information about how to apply.&nbsp;</div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 16px;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><br></span></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 16px;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">To apply for the fall 2017 semester, we must receive your application between&nbsp;<b>October 1 and December 15</b>. Our priority deadline for the fall semester is&nbsp;<b>December 1</b>.</span></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 16px;"><br></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 16px;">If you need further information or have any questions, please let me know.</div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 16px;"><br></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 16px;">Sincerely,</div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 16px;"><br></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 16px;"><p class="MsoNormal"><b><span style="font-size: 24pt; font-family: 'Kunstler Script';">Wendi Simonson</span></b><o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal"><b><font color="#990000">Arizona State University</font>&nbsp;|&nbsp;<font color="#ffcc33">School of Life Sciences</font></b></p><p class="MsoNormal">SOLS Graduate Programs Coordinator&nbsp;</p><p class="MsoNormal">PO Box 874601 | Tempe, AZ 85287-4601</p><p class="MsoNormal">Phone: 480-965-7490 | Fax: 480-965-7599</p><p class="MsoNormal">email: sols.grad@asu.edu</p><p class="MsoNormal"><br></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#CCCCCC">{!Case.Thread_Id}</span><o:p></o:p></p></div></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>